1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:03,599
Can darkness be a form of light — to say

2
00:00:03,659 --> 00:00:05,219
that laws can be undone?

3
00:00:06,980 --> 00:00:10,519
Can daylight shine within the night, where

4
00:00:10,619 --> 00:00:13,079
black would color white and sun?

5
00:00:14,719 --> 00:00:15,979
Are feelings felt?

6
00:00:16,940 --> 00:00:17,879
Can they be known?

7
00:00:19,359 --> 00:00:21,100
Our minds are always on the move.

8
00:00:22,239 --> 00:00:26,680
We say our love is something shown; I ask

9
00:00:26,779 --> 00:00:28,799
if love can be removed.

10
00:00:30,479 --> 00:00:33,139
Would I fall up if you were down?

11
00:00:34,700 --> 00:00:36,879
The rules of life are always vague.

12
00:00:37,939 --> 00:00:40,599
Can you sense a soul, like sound?

13
00:00:42,239 --> 00:00:45,180
I want to know if morals fade.

14
00:00:46,919 --> 00:00:51,599
So shadow-shine, and breath align — but

15
00:00:51,680 --> 00:00:53,659
only in my waking mind.

16
00:00:55,219 --> 00:00:59,079
I thought I’d found what was a sign, but I

17
00:00:59,139 --> 00:01:00,819
will never draw the lines.

